[36m(TaskRunner pid=2227203)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2227203)[0m \frac{96 + 144i}{4(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta)} = \frac{96 + 144i}{4} \cdot \frac{\cos\theta - i\sin\theta}{\cos^2\theta + \sin^2\theta} = \frac{96\cos\theta - 144i\cos\theta + 96i\sin\theta + 144\sin\theta}{4} = \frac{96\cos\theta + 144\sin\theta + i(96\sin\theta - 144\cos\theta)}{4} = 24\cos\theta + 36\sin\theta + i(24\sin\theta - 36\cos\theta)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2227203)[0m \]
