[36m(TaskRunner pid=2227203)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2227203)[0m Let's represent \(z\) in polar form. Since \(|z| = 4\), we can write \(z = 4e^{i\theta}\) for some real angle \(\theta\). Then, we have:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2227203)[0m \[z = 4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta)\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2227203)[0m and
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2227203)[0m \[\frac{1}{z} = \frac{1}{4}(\cos \theta - i \sin \theta).\]
