[36m(TaskRunner pid=2227203)[0m Now we can substitute \(z\) and \(\frac{1}{z}\) into the expression:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2227203)[0m \[(75 + 117i)z + \frac{96 + 144i}{z} = (75 + 117i)4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4}(\cos \theta - i \sin \theta).\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2227203)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2227203)[0m Let's expand this expression:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2227203)[0m \[(75 + 117i)4(\cos \theta + i \sin \theta) = 4(75 \cos \theta + 117i \cos \theta + 75i \sin \theta - 117 \sin \theta) = 4(75 \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta + i(117 \cos \theta + 75 \sin \theta)),\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2227203)[0m and
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2227203)[0m \[\frac{96 + 144i}{4}(\cos \theta - i \sin \theta) = \frac{1}{4}(96 \cos \theta - 144i \cos \theta + 96i \sin \theta + 144 \sin \theta) = \frac{1}{4}(96 \cos \theta + 144 \sin \theta + i(96 \sin \theta - 144 \cos \theta)).\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2227203)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2227203)[0m Combining these, we get:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2227203)[0m \[4(75 \cos \theta - 117 \sin \theta + i(117 \cos \theta + 75 \sin \theta)) + \frac{1}{4}(96 \cos \theta + 144 \sin \theta + i(96 \sin \theta - 144 \cos \theta)).\]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2227203)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2227203)[0m Separating the real and imaginary parts, we have:
