[36m(TaskRunner pid=2227203)[0m To maximize this real part, we need to maximize the expression \(324 \cos \theta - 432 \sin \theta\). The maximum value of \(a \cos \theta + b \sin \theta\) is \(\sqrt{a^2 + b^2}\). So, the maximum value of \(324 \cos \theta - 432 \sin \theta\) is \(\sqrt{324^2 + 432^2}\).
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2227203)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2227203)[0m Let's calculate this:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2227203)[0m \[\sqrt{324^2 + 432^2} = \sqrt{104976 + 186624} = \sqrt{291600} = 540.\]
