[36m(TaskRunner pid=2227203)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2227203)[0m = 4(75 + 117i)(\cos\theta + i\sin\theta) + \frac{96 + 144i}{4}(\cos\theta - i\sin\theta)
